```http
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### GET /preferences/ - Custom preferences
# Expected status: 200
# Expected response:
# {
#   "preferences": {
#     "theme": "dark",
#     "font_size": 16,
#     "language": "en"
#   }
# }

GET {{baseUrl}}/preferences/
Cookie: theme=dark; font_size=16; language=en
```
